sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as Web界面
    participant Noti as Notification
    participant DB as 数据库

    U->>UI: 打开通知面板
    UI->>Noti: list(userId) / unread-count
    Noti->>DB: SELECT notifications
    DB-->>Noti: 列表与未读数
    Noti-->>UI: records + count
    UI-->>U: 展示通知

    U->>UI: 标记单条或全部已读
    UI->>Noti: markRead(id 或全部)
    Noti->>DB: UPDATE is_read
    Noti-->>UI: code=200
    UI-->>U: 未读数清零或减少
